@startuml 24_seq_http_check
title External checker and private workspace service status (FL-19)
participant "Supabase cron" as Scheduler
participant "Supabase Edge Function" as Worker
participant "Approved public service" as Endpoint
database "Private PostgreSQL" as DB
Scheduler -> Worker : Scheduled invocation
Worker -> DB : Load enabled workspace services
DB --> Worker : Approved targets
Worker -> Worker : Validate DNS, IP and redirect policy
alt safe public destination
 Worker -> Endpoint : Bounded HTTP GET
 alt allowed success response
  Endpoint --> Worker : 2xx/3xx and latency
  Worker -> DB : Commit HEALTHY + latency
 else HTTP/network failure
  Endpoint --> Worker : failure/timeout
  Worker -> DB : Commit UNHEALTHY + reason
 end
else unsafe destination
 Worker -> Worker : Reject before any outbound request
end
note right of Worker : Not a FastAPI in-process timer.
@enduml
